{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2023-02-16 06:30:00', 'title': 'ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES ANNOUNCES FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'LINCOLNSHIRE, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ZBRA #EARNINGS--ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ZBRA), AN INNOVATOR AT THE EDGE OF THE ENTERPRISE WITH SOLUTIONS AND PARTNERS THAT ENABLE BUSINESSES TO GAIN A PERFORMANCE EDGE, TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. “OUR TEAM DELIVERED STRONG FOURTH QUARTER RESULTS TO CLOSE A CHALLENGING YEAR.'}